---
import { APPLY_FORM_URL } from "../consts";
---

<section id="cta" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-ink px-6 py-16 text-center text-white md:py-20" data-reveal>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-0 opacity-30">
      <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-64 w-[640px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">100件まで無料。モニター募集中。</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-300" style="text-wrap: balance;">
        <span class="inline-block">相場の根拠のある買取査定を、まずは現場で。</span>
        <span class="inline-block">審査のうえアカウントを発行します。</span>
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href={APPLY_FORM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="rounded-xl bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100">
          無料モニターに応募
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
